    "title": "You Haven't Truly Lived Until You've Tried The Colossal Cheeseburgers At This Tiny Michigan Restaurant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Savannah Walker ,\n21 hours ago Sometimes the best things in life come in small packages, and The Whitehouse Restaurant in Clare, Michigan proves this delicious truth with every burger they flip. This unassuming roadside gem serves up some of the most ridiculously oversized, jaw-droppingly tasty cheeseburgers you’ll ever attempt to fit in your mouth. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
